# Environment
.env
.env.local
!.env.example
!.env.local.example

# Alembic revisions MUST be tracked — they are the schema's source of truth.
# CI builds the backend image from a clean checkout, so an ignored revision
# means `alembic upgrade head` runs against an empty versions/ dir and silently
# creates no tables on the server.

